chunks.text:
[Intro]
{a cold sub-bass drone with a low growl under it}
{a reversed riser that slams into a massive deep brass blast on the last beat}

[Nights]
{relentless industrial horror pulse: distorted 808 sub bass, pounding toms and metal percussion like pans and doors slammed in time}
{a creepy detuned toy piano melody on top, a growling distorted low synth that swells, a dissonant string ostinato}
{the tension rises non-stop and hits harder every 8 bars, peaking in the last three seconds}

[Reveal]
{half a second of dead silence, then a colossal horror explosion}
{huge deep brass blasts, a wordless dark choir, distorted drums, screeching strings, maximum terror}
{a first massive hit at 4.7 seconds, a brutal hit at 10 seconds, then a ringing aftermath that fades to near silence by 15 seconds}
